title: "Balance of Power 2026"
abstract: "A turn-based multipolar crisis simulation for IR research and war studies pedagogy. Eight scenarios across thirteen domains and eight actors; browser wargame and headless Oracle API for batch runs and counterfactuals. Stylized, rule-based AI with cascade dynamics."
